# Context budget for this project, in bytes. Read by CCHealth's /sweep and /wrap.
#
# The workspace default is CLAUDE.md=20000 MEMORY.md=12000; a project only needs
# this file if it wants a different ceiling. Keep it in sync with the prose rule
# it mirrors — here, "Release hygiene gate" rule 1 in CLAUDE.md.
#
# It lives OUTSIDE CLAUDE.md on purpose: the first version was an HTML comment
# inside the file, and its own 178 bytes pushed PTApp back over the very gate it
# was declaring. A budget declaration must not consume the budget.
#
# 22 KB rather than 20: ~3.4 KB of that file is a Topic Router that buys keyword
# reach into all 83 docs. Raised 2026-08-05, adopted by CCHealth the same day.
#
# 24 KB from 2026-08-21 (v2.18): the design pass turned the visual language into
# a per-session RULE SET — paint only from tokens, the accent never touches
# chrome, no uppercase or letter-spacing under RTL, one screen per pass. Those
# belong inline (hygiene rule 4: a durable rule never lives only in a changelog),
# and routing them would mean a session repaints a screen without ever reading
# them. ~1 KB of genuinely new law, bought deliberately.

# 26 KB from 2026-08-22 (v2.22): the figures are a new SUBSYSTEM, not a screen —
# a pose file, a canon, a serialiser and four geometric traps that a session will
# hit the first time it draws a movement. Routing them would mean drawing 334
# figures without ever reading them (hygiene rule 4). Raised again the same day
# for v2.22.1, which added three more figure-internal tokens with derived
# meanings and a third-camera rule: ~2 KB of new law in total, bought
# deliberately. Next release that touches this file COLLAPSES the v2.21 history
# line rather than raising again.

CLAUDE.md=27000
MEMORY.md=12000
